Z||000004||WKDFIRO||03-15-2001||10:23 PM||||OHhhh....so the Knotts Berry Farm show lives! A friend of mine on the cabinet of the Kit Car club that puts it on was unsure of where it was going to be now that there is a water park in the old location. Its been a while since I talked with him. We have had those two shows on the same weekend since Outlaw started having their shows.<P>We usually meet there as a club on Saturday and then meet at the Chicken Restraunt at a certain time for lunch.<P>Anyone interested?<P>(I'll be putting it into the newsletter coming out tomorrow or Saturday, Eric)||||reg||6
