Z||000007||WKDFIRO||04-09-2001||04:09 AM||||Im glad you bumped this up I would not have seen it! I might as well make this a blanket message for anyone else in Southern California!<BR> <BR>If you wish to be an ACTIVE member of a Fiero Club, Fieros West wants YOU!<P>We are desperately seeking Fierophiles who love to drive their Fiero at the drop of a wrench! What good is having the best weather in the nation if you don't want to drive your Fiero in it!?<P>Im not just a member, I get to call myself the President (and editor) of Fieros West!<P>Anyone want more info e-mail me and then call Chris West (he and Eric are our esteemed Activities Coordinators!) for upcoming events and lets go driving Excitement!<P>I won't be able to make it to the Ventura show but I will be at the Knotts Show on Saturday. I'll be the one in the green Fieros West shirt (if its not too chilly, where did this rain come from???)<BR>||||reg||6
Z||000008||fyerstarter||04-09-2001||12:55 PM||||DUDE!! Yeah def thanks for bumping this little tidbit up. I live right by Ventura, and Sunday is my only day off during April!! I'm there......||||reg||1
